/* Error shown when editing a logged food entry fails. */
"This entry can't be edited here -- it has no food to log again. You can delete it instead." = "Tenhle záznam tady nejde upravit – nemá jídlo, které by šlo zapsat znovu. Můžeš ho ale smazat.";

/* Error shown when editing a logged food entry fails. */
"Nothing changed." = "Nic se nezměnilo.";

/* Error shown when editing a logged food entry fails. */
"This entry is just reaching Garmin. Try again in a moment." = "Tenhle záznam se právě odesílá do Garminu. Zkus to za chvíli znovu.";

/* Error shown when editing a logged food entry fails. */
"This entry changed in the meantime. Pull to refresh and try again." = "Záznam se mezitím změnil. Stáhni obrazovku dolů pro obnovení a zkus to znovu.";

/* Validation error under an amount field. First %@ is the maximum amount (e.g. 25000), second %@ the unit symbol (g or ml). */
"Enter an amount greater than zero and at most %@ %@." = "Zadej množství větší než nula a nejvýše %@ %@.";

/* Note under a custom food. %@ is the name of the Garmin food it is actually logged as. */
"Recorded in Garmin as \"%@\" (closest match; custom-food creation isn't confirmed possible via Garmin's API yet)." = "V Garminu zapsáno jako „%@“ (nejbližší shoda; vytvoření vlastního jídla přes Garmin API zatím není ověřené).";

/* Offline food database update error. */
"The downloaded index isn't a gzip file." = "Stažená databáze není soubor gzip.";

/* Offline food database update error. %@ is a technical detail in English. */
"The downloaded index is corrupted (%@)." = "Stažená databáze je poškozená (%@).";

/* Offline food database update error. %lld is the format version number. */
"The index uses format %lld, which needs a newer app." = "Databáze používá formát %lld, který potřebuje novější verzi aplikace.";

/* Offline food database update error. %@ is a technical detail in English. */
"The index couldn't be read (%@)." = "Databázi se nepodařilo načíst (%@).";

/* Offline food database update error. */
"The downloaded index failed its checksum." = "Stažená databáze neprošla kontrolou kontrolního součtu.";

/* Offline food database update error. %@ is a technical detail in English. */
"The index manifest is invalid (%@)." = "Popis databáze (manifest) je neplatný (%@).";

/* Offline food database update error. %lld is the HTTP status code. */
"The index server answered HTTP %lld." = "Server s databází odpověděl HTTP %lld.";

/* ---- Notifications (NotificationPlanning.swift) ---- */

/* Streak-at-risk reminder notification title. */
"Keep your streak alive" = "Udrž svou sérii";

/* Streak-at-risk reminder notification body. */
"You haven't logged anything today yet -- don't lose your streak." = "Dnes zatím nemáš nic zapsáno – nepřijď o svou sérii.";

/* Daily-challenge reminder notification title. */
"Today's challenges are ready" = "Dnešní výzvy jsou připravené";

/* Daily-challenge reminder notification body. */
"Check today's challenges in GarminFood." = "Mrkni na dnešní výzvy v GarminFood.";

/* Meal reminder notification title (one full sentence per meal: Czech accusative). */
"Log your breakfast" = "Zapiš si snídani";

/* Meal reminder notification title. */
"Log your lunch" = "Zapiš si oběd";

/* Meal reminder notification title. */
"Log your dinner" = "Zapiš si večeři";

/* Meal reminder notification title (Garmin's Snacks meal slot). */
"Log your snacks" = "Zapiš si svačinu";

/* Meal reminder notification body. */
"Don't forget to log breakfast today." = "Nezapomeň si dnes zapsat snídani.";

/* Meal reminder notification body. */
"Don't forget to log lunch today." = "Nezapomeň si dnes zapsat oběd.";

/* Meal reminder notification body. */
"Don't forget to log dinner today." = "Nezapomeň si dnes zapsat večeři.";

/* Meal reminder notification body (Garmin's Snacks meal slot). */
"Don't forget to log snacks today." = "Nezapomeň si dnes zapsat svačinu.";

/* Fasting reminder notification title, shortly before the daily fast ends. */
"Fasting window ending soon" = "Půst brzy končí";

/* Fasting reminder notification title, shortly before the fast starts. %lld is minutes; 'min' is a unit symbol, so no plural. */
"Fasting starts in %lld min" = "Půst začíná za %lld min";

/* Fasting reminder notification body. %@ is a 24-hour clock time (HH:mm). */
"Your fasting window starts at %@." = "Tvůj půst začíná v %@.";

/* Error when a food entry has an invalid date (standalone mode, food log kept on the phone). */
"This day can't be saved in the food log on this phone." = "Tento den nejde uložit do jídelníčku v telefonu.";

/* Error when writing the on-phone food log fails (standalone mode). %@ is the system's reason. */
"Couldn't save the food log on this phone: %@" = "Jídelníček v telefonu se nepodařilo uložit: %@";

/* Standalone mode: a food from Open Food Facts without calories can't be logged. */
"This food has no calorie value, so it can't be logged. Create a custom food with its calories instead." = "Tahle potravina nemá uvedené kalorie, takže ji nejde zapsat. Vytvoř si místo ní vlastní potravinu s kaloriemi.";

/* A custom food created without Garmin (standalone mode) can't be logged to Garmin until a closest Garmin food is picked. */
"Needs a Garmin match before it can be logged to Garmin." = "Než to půjde zapsat do Garminu, je potřeba vybrat shodu v Garminu.";
